@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "help.center.assertion.only"

Feature: Downloads
	Testing the Downloads portlet

Setup: 
	* I log into the support homepage as "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" with password "test"
	* I go to the Downloads page

Scenario: View Downloads Multiple Page Results
	Viewing multiple pages of downloads should work properly

	Given I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product and "Fix Packs" file type
	Then the download with the name "Liferay DXP 7.0 Fix Pack 75" should be visible with the following values
	| Date         | Mar 5, 2019                                                                                                              |
	| Name         | Liferay DXP 7.0 Fix Pack 75                                                                                              |
	| Link         | Changelog                                                                                                                |
	| Link         | Important Changes                                                                                                        |
	| Link         | Known Issues                                                                                                             |
	| Link         | Installation Instructions                                                                                                |
	| Info Message | This fix pack provides a solution for SEV-3 security issues in LPE-16681, LPE-16680, LPE-16677, LPE-16670 and LPE-16659. |
	| Size         | File Size: 303 MB                                                                                                        |
	| MD5          | MD5: DF3D6B725EE15BAFE045B4651CF220C7                                                                                    |
	And the current page number of the download results page should be page "1"
	When I go to the next page of the download search results
	Then the download with the name "Liferay DXP 7.0 Fix Pack 60" should be visible with the following values
